safetyPrecautions:
The prototype will be equipped with the following safety measures:
Resistor guard: the three 10 W heating resistors will be enclosed/guarded to avoid any accidental touching of hot spots;
Transparent protective enclosure: To avoid any accidental touching of the moving mechanism (deploying fins, hinges, springs, lever and latch) and keep the whole mechanism under surveillance, a clear acrylic enclosure will be placed around the mechanism;
Controlled heating: To avoid abrupt temperature increase or overheating, the heating power will be increased stepwise during testing;
Safe material placement: The place where the acrylic enclosure is placed will be kept away from the hottest spots;
Sharp-edge protection: The exposed aluminium edging from the fins and other mechanical parts will be finished or enclosed where necessary;
Stable mounting: The whole mechanism will be firmly mounted on a stable base during the demonstration;
Electrical isolation/control: A main ON/OFF switch and suitable DC power supply will be employed;
Temperature monitoring: K-type thermocouples will be used to monitor heat source and heatsink temperatures during the tests.
